        {
          "text": " Muri abana b'Uwiteka Imana yanyu, ntimukiraburishe kwikeba ku mubiri, haba no kwitegera ibiharanjongo uwapfuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.1",
